# Pinned upstream Paperclip version.
#
# This file is intentionally a placeholder: the sandbox this deployment
# layer was authored in has no network access to the npm registry or
# GitHub, so no real release version could be resolved or verified here.
#
# During first bring-up on the laptop (README.md "Bring-up, step by step"),
# run:
#
#   npx --registry https://registry.npmjs.org paperclipai install
#   paperclipai doctor    # prints the resolved installed version
#
# then replace the line below with that exact version and commit it, so
# every later `scripts/up.sh` and the upgrade procedure pin to a known-good
# release instead of silently floating to "latest".
PAPERCLIP_VERSION=UNPINNED-FILL-IN-DURING-FIRST-BRING-UP
